{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# System｜结构图\n项目语义键与共享资产入口。[[System/结构|结构文档]] · [[计划蓝图|模块导航]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1530,
      "height": 125,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "tags",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GGYGOGameplayTags\n原生 Tag 常量：Input/Ability/Group/State/Restriction/Event/Cue/Message。\n各模块只认同一语义键。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "manager",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAssetManager\n`Get()` → 单例或错误日志+兜底。\n`StartInitialLoading()` → 启动预载。\n`GetGameData()` → 可空共享资产；按类缓存。",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameData\n`Get()` → 可空。\nDamage / Heal / SelfDestruct GE 类引用；项目级 C++ 共用资产。",
      "x": 1110,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "consumers",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AbilitySystem / Input / GameMode\n消费 Tag 与共享 GE；角色专属 AbilitySet/PawnData 仍归各自模块。[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[GameFeature/结构]]",
      "x": 550,
      "y": 700,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 共享基础接口\nGGYGOGameplayTags 提供静态 Tag 语义键，Input/ASC/AI/消息只共享键，不经 System 互相调用。\nUGGYGOAssetManager::Get/GetGameData → UGGYGOGameData 的 Damage/Heal/SelfDestruct GE；调用方处理可空值与资产缺失。\nPawnData/AbilitySet 是关卡或角色配置，不应塞进全局 GameData；System 不持有角色状态。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
